### ============================================================
### Composición — variantes compuestas (six-pack / lote)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl       = http://localhost:3000
@tenantId      = FILL_ME
@bottleId      = FILL_ME
@sixpackId     = FILL_ME
@warehouseId   = FILL_ME

# ─── Definir composición: 1 sixpack = 6 botellas ───────────
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-composition
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
  "parent_product_variant_id": "{{sixpackId}}",
  "components": [
    { "child_product_variant_id": "{{bottleId}}", "quantity": 6 }
  ]
}

# ─── Listar componentes del padre ──────────────────────────
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-composition/{{tenantId}}/parent/{{sixpackId}}

# ─── Reverse lookup: padres que usan la botella ────────────
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-composition/{{tenantId}}/child/{{bottleId}}

# ─── Stock virtual del compuesto ───────────────────────────
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-composition/{{tenantId}}/availability/{{sixpackId}}/{{warehouseId}}

# ─── Actualizar la cantidad de un componente ───────────────
###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/product-composition/{{tenantId}}/parent/{{sixpackId}}/component/{{bottleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 8 }

# ─── Limpiar la composición (parent vuelve a is_composite=false) ──
###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/product-composition/{{tenantId}}/parent/{{sixpackId}}

# ─── Caso de error: ciclo ──────────────────────────────────
### A -> B (ok), luego B -> A debe responder 400.
@variantA = FILL_ME
@variantB = FILL_ME

POST {{baseUrl}}/product-composition
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
  "parent_product_variant_id": "{{variantA}}",
  "components": [{ "child_product_variant_id": "{{variantB}}", "quantity": 2 }]
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-composition
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
  "parent_product_variant_id": "{{variantB}}",
  "components": [{ "child_product_variant_id": "{{variantA}}", "quantity": 1 }]
}

# ─── Recepción de PO con compuesto ─────────────────────────
### Recibir 10 sixpacks @ ¢6000 → debe sumar 60 a la botella
### con unit_cost 1000 (¢6000 / 6).
### (Usa el flujo existente de purchase order receive.)

# ─── Venta con explosión ───────────────────────────────────
### POST /sale/full vendiendo 2 sixpacks → -12 botellas en
### inventario del warehouse is_branch=true.
